@* نوار کناریِ پورتال — در چیدمانِ راست‌به‌چپ در سمت راست قرار می‌گیرد *@
@inject Services.AuthState Auth
@implements IDisposable

<aside class="side @(open ? "is-open" : "")">
    <div class="side__head">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
            <span class="brand__mark">NW</span>
            <span class="brand__name">فروغ آریا پارسیان</span>
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="side__body">
        <div class="side__group">
            <div class="side__label">حساب کاربری</div>
            <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard" Match="NavLinkMatch.All">
                <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="grid" Size="17" /></span> پیشخوان
            </NavLink>
            <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/orders">
                <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="file" Size="17" /></span> سفارش‌ها
                @if (Auth.IsAdmin) { <span class="side__count">@Helpers.Fa.Num(orderCount)</span> }
            </NavLink>
            <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/invoices">
                <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="receipt" Size="17" /></span> فاکتورها
            </NavLink>
            <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/licenses">
                <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="key" Size="17" /></span> لایسنس‌ها
                <span class="side__count">@Helpers.Fa.Num(licenseCount)</span>
            </NavLink>
            <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/downloads">
                <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="download" Size="17" /></span> دانلودها
            </NavLink>
            <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/tickets">
                <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="ticket" Size="17" /></span> تیکت‌ها
                @if (ticketCount > 0) { <span class="side__count">@Helpers.Fa.Num(ticketCount)</span> }
            </NavLink>
            <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/profile">
                <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="user" Size="17" /></span> پروفایل
            </NavLink>
        </div>

        @if (Auth.IsAdmin)
        {
            <div class="side__group">
                <div class="side__label">مدیریت</div>
                <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/admin">
                    <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="chart" Size="17" /></span> نمای کلی
                </NavLink>
                <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/admin/products">
                    <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="package" Size="17" /></span> محصولات
                </NavLink>
                <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/admin/categories">
                    <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="layers" Size="17" /></span> دسته‌بندی‌ها
                </NavLink>
                <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/admin/customers">
                    <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="users" Size="17" /></span> مشتریان
                </NavLink>
                <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/admin/orders">
                    <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="truck" Size="17" /></span> سفارش‌ها
                </NavLink>
                <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/admin/licenses">
                    <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="key" Size="17" /></span> لایسنس‌ها
                </NavLink>
                <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/admin/discounts">
                    <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="percent" Size="17" /></span> کدهای تخفیف
                </NavLink>
                <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/admin/reviews">
                    <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="message" Size="17" /></span> نقد و بررسی
                    @if (reviewCount > 0) { <span class="side__count">@Helpers.Fa.Num(reviewCount)</span> }
                </NavLink>
                <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/admin/tickets">
                    <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="ticket" Size="17" /></span> تیکت‌ها
                </NavLink>
                <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/admin/demo-requests">
                    <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="monitor" Size="17" /></span> درخواست‌های دمو
                </NavLink>
                <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/admin/blog">
                    <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="book" Size="17" /></span> وبلاگ و مقالات
                </NavLink>
                <NavLink class="side__link" href="/dashboard/admin/settings">
                    <span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="settings" Size="17" /></span> تنظیمات سایت
                </NavLink>
            </div>
        }

        <div class="side__group">
            <div class="side__label">فروشگاه</div>
            <a class="side__link" href="/"><span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="globe" Size="17" /></span> نمای فروشگاه</a>
            <a class="side__link" href="/support"><span class="side__icon"><Icon Name="shield" Size="17" /></span> مرکز پشتیبانی</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="side__foot">
        <button class="side__user" @onclick="Logout" title="خروج">
            <span class="avatar">@Helpers.Fa.Initials(Auth.User?.FullName ?? "م")</span>
            <span class="grow" style="text-align:right">
                <span class="side__user-name">@(Auth.User?.FullName ?? "کاربر")</span>
                <span class="side__user-mail">@(Auth.User?.Email ?? "")</span>
            </span>
            <span style="color:var(--text-4)"><Icon Name="logout" Size="16" /></span>
        </button>
    </div>
</aside>

@if (open)
{
    <div class="side__scrim" @onclick="() => open = false"></div>
}

@code {
    [Parameter] public bool Open { get; set; }

    private bool open;
    private int ticketCount, licenseCount, orderCount, reviewCount;

    protected override void OnParametersSet() => open = Open;

    protected override void OnInitialized()
    {
        Auth.OnChange += OnAuthChanged;
        _ = LoadCounts();
    }

    private async Task LoadCounts()
    {
        if (Auth.IsAdmin)
        {
            var o = await Api.GetAdminOverviewAsync();
            ticketCount = o.OpenTickets;
            licenseCount = o.ActiveLicenses;
            orderCount = o.TotalProducts;
            reviewCount = o.PendingReviews;
        }
        else if (Auth.IsAuthenticated)
        {
            var o = await Api.GetCustomerOverviewAsync();
            ticketCount = o.OpenTickets;
            licenseCount = o.ActiveLicenses;
            orderCount = o.OrderCount;
        }
        StateHasChanged();
    }

    private void OnAuthChanged() => _ = LoadCounts();

    [Inject] public Services.IStoreApi Api { get; set; } = default!;
    [Inject] public NavigationManager Nav { get; set; } = default!;

    private async Task Logout()
    {
        await Auth.LogoutAsync();
        Nav.NavigateTo("/", forceLoad: false);
    }

    public void Dispose() => Auth.OnChange -= OnAuthChanged;
}
